      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我最近记了很多新词，但是很快就忘。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你是怎么记的？只看词表吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "差不多。我会看中文、拼音和土耳其语。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这样可以开始，但是最好放进句子里。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "自己造句吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，而且句子不用太难。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "比如学“安排”，我可以说“我安排周末的时间”。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "很好。再加一个跟你生活有关的例子。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "“工作忙的时候，我会重新安排任务。”",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这样就比单独看一个词容易记。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我要不要每天复习很多词？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "不用太多，少一点儿但是经常复习更好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我可以把最难的词放到最前面。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，也可以用你喜欢的例句。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这样学习好像更有意思。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "因为不是在背词，是在用词。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，我今天先改十个词。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc021_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "做完以后别忘了休息。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
